<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-113-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.451727" lon="-120.990545"><name>SC26-113-B</name><cmt>SC26-113</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 61/100; not catch probability. Center 48 ft; nearby 44–65 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-090</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.4545753032534" lon="-120.99108024275633"/><trkpt lat="35.45439874586394" lon="-120.9913049879427"/><trkpt lat="35.4536760160489" lon="-120.9912127811248"/><trkpt lat="35.453773460567035" lon="-120.99165106437302"/><trkpt lat="35.45422402101057" lon="-120.99163986373517"/><trkpt lat="35.454150401281225" lon="-120.9926332875114"/><trkpt lat="35.45388006485141" lon="-120.99264000458284"/><trkpt lat="35.453885560442" lon="-120.99297039820091"/><trkpt lat="35.45244193396896" lon="-120.99289608593106"/><trkpt lat="35.45244559720092" lon="-120.99311634444858"/><trkpt lat="35.45217526061453" lon="-120.99312305948203"/><trkpt lat="35.45216610187268" lon="-120.99257241510216"/><trkpt lat="35.451895765363965" lon="-120.99257913188559"/><trkpt lat="35.451904924014904" lon="-120.99312977442605"/><trkpt lat="35.4515444751948